  "details": "Hey! Loving the new design of the portals in the open beta. I've thought about this even before the redesign of the portals, and it begs it even more after the redesign.\n\nSomething like a quiet spacey hum when they're nearby (something not too distracting but also as a way to tell there's a portal nearby) and also some swooshing in and out sounds (that would fit the new animations for it popping in and out).\n\nI also thought about notifications (join/leave) but I found a canny for that already so I just voted on it.",
